ot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;9.5k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;763&lt;br&gt;The Swift code generator for your assets, storyboards, Localizable.strings, … — Get rid of all String-based APIs!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/AliSoftware/Reusable&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reusable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;3k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;231&lt;br&gt;A Swift mixin for reusing views easily and in a type-safe way (UITableViewCells, UICollectionViewCells, custom UIViews, ViewControllers, Storyboards…)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/AliSoftware/Dip&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;979 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt